@* The miniature a theme card draws: a sidebar, a panel and two lines of text, painted from the
   --swatch-* properties of the card around it, with the accent the person picked as the one chip. *@
<span class="theme-card-rail"></span>
<span class="theme-card-panel"><span class="theme-card-line"></span><span class="theme-card-line is-short"></span><span class="theme-card-chip"></span></span>
